    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lumina's Brew</i> is a cozy metroidvania where you play as Lumina, a witch whose heart has been separated from her body and transformed into a living flame. As you explore lush forests, eerie swamps, and fiery volcanic caves, you'll gather ingredients to craft potions, unlock hidden paths, and uncover the truth behind your curse. Along the way, you'll discover Tarot cards that not only enhance your abilities but also unlock secret doors and portals, revealing new areas and valuable resources. Journey through this mystical world, reconnect with your heart, and master the art of potion-making in a beautifully crafted 2D pixel world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lumina's Brew</i> is a cozy metroidvania where you play as Lumina, a witch whose heart has been separated from her body and transformed into a living flame. As you explore lush forests, eerie swamps, and fiery volcanic caves, you'll gather ingredients to craft potions, unlock hidden paths, and uncover the truth behind your curse. Along the way, you'll discover Tarot cards that not only enhance your abilities but also unlock secret doors and portals, revealing new areas and valuable resources. Journey through this mystical world, reconnect with your heart, and master the art of potion-making in a beautifully crafted 2D pixel world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore enchanted biomes, gather rare ingredients, and brew potions to sell in this cozy 2D metroidvania. Discover secrets, meet curious creatures, and master the art of potion-making as a young witch on a mystical journey.",
